## Jenkins setup

1. docker network create jenkins
2. docker build -t myjenkins-blueocean:latest
3. docker run --name jenkins-blueocean --restart=on-failure --detach --network jenkins --env DOCKER_HOST=tcp://docker:2376 --env DOCKER_CERT_PATH=/certs/client --env DOCKER_TLS_VERIFY= --volume jenkins-data:/var/jenkins_home --volume jenkins-docker-certs:/certs/client:ro --publish 8080:8080 --publish 50000:50000 myjenkins-blueocean:latest
4. Go to http://localhost:8080
5. docker exec jenkins-blueocean cat /var/jenkins_home/secrets/initialAdminPassword
